      "writtenOn": "2023-10-19T21:22:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see a performance drop of about 3% with CONFIG_BLK_CGROUP_IOPRIO\u003dy compared to CONFIG_BLK_CGROUP_IOPRIO\u003dn when using the null_blk driver (see also https://b.corp.google.com/issues/305274387). The performance impact will be lower with a real block driver since real block drivers spend more time processing I/O than the null_blk driver.",
      "parentUuid": "8eae9d27_26c3de0d",
      "revId": "9d59a90f894ffa7ed3565618da7bd59e1ff4a990",
